"Sophie is a female grivek lab assistant at LeafSong University; Joe chose her name."
"Like all griveks she looks like a giant hairless panther with joints bent the wrong way."
"She wears a helmet with a reflective visor and a vest of interwoven straps."
"She calls Alden Thorn Aaaatiir."
"She guards the irradiators, reports cheating and protects people in catastrophes."
"She has worked the exams three of her planet's years, about seven Earth years."
"She has heightened speed and extreme regeneration, and her rank is four."
"She hunts and butchers her own meals in the jungle at night."
"She finds it disturbing that humans eat food others slaughtered."
"She warned Alden about Joe: know your mind before you make your choices."
"She told Alden to separate his physical senses from his magical ones."
"She gave Alden permission to contact her; by griveck custom she then may not slaughter him."
"She says Alden smells like prey and offered to let him burrow underground with her."
"Her world is Sreeeakk; when Alden called her after his return she vowed to hunt slower."
